{
  "uid": "nawara-core-messaging",
  "title": "Core · Messaging",
  "description": "V2 A12.6.2: Core application messaging (per consumer queue) and the RabbitMQ broker (aggregate), LOCAL observability. Provisioned from the repository; edits in the UI are not saved.",
  "tags": [
    "nawara-core",
    "local"
  ],
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "timezone": "browser",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "30s",
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "type": "query",
        "name": "queue",
        "label": "Consumer queue",
        "description": "A queue a Core service consumes (from nawara_event_consumer_up; bounded by the service-kit).",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "nawara-prometheus"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(nawara_event_consumer_up{job=~\"auth-service|billing-service|payment-service|organization-service|notification-service|file-service|audit-service|release-service\"}, queue)",
        "query": "label_values(nawara_event_consumer_up{job=~\"auth-service|billing-service|payment-service|organization-service|notification-service|file-service|audit-service|release-service\"}, queue)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "regex": "",
        "sort": 1,
        "multi": false,
        "includeAll": false,
        "hide": 0,
        "skipUrlSync": false
      }
    ]
  },
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Application consumers (all Core queues)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Consumers attached",
      "description": "`nawara_event_consumer_up` per Core service and queue: 1 consuming, 0 lost or closed. Only services that consume have a series.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "nawara-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "nawara-prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "nawara_event_consumer_up{job=~\"auth-service|billing-service|payment-service|organization-service|notification-service|file-service|audit-service|release-service\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}} · {{queue}}",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "noValue": "no consumers",
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "LOST",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "ATTACHED",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true,
        "showPercentChange": false
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Application dead-lettered — parked in <queue>.dead (since start)",
      "description": "APPLICATION dead-letter outcomes from `nawara_events_consumed_total`, per service, queue and outcome, since each process started: messages a Core consumer gave up on and parked (malformed, permanent failure, retries exhausted; `dead_letter_unannotated`: parked by the broker's dead-lettering without the annotated copy). This is the permanent dead-letter signal. It is NOT the broker dead-letter counter below, and not the dead-letter queue depth (per-queue depth is deferred; `nawara-check-dlq` remains the tool). \"none observed\": nothing parked since start.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "nawara-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 10,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "nawara-prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (job, queue, outcome) (nawara_events_consumed_total{job=~\"auth-service|billing-service|payment-service|organization-service|notification-service|file-service|audit-service|release-service\",outcome=~\"dead_lettered_malformed|dead_lettered_permanent|dead_lettered_retries_exhausted|dead_letter_unannotated\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}} · {{queue}} · {{outcome}}",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "noValue": "none observed",
          "mappings": [],
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true,
        "showPercentChange": false
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Dead-letter deferred (since start)",
      "description": "`dead_letter_deferred`: the dead-letter copy could not be confirmed, so the message was held and requeued (not parked, not lost). Recurring: the broker is refusing the copy. \"none observed\": none since start.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "nawara-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
